    <string name="privacy">Privacy policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_desc">What happens to your data</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">Depter stores all customers, entries and settings only on your phone. The app has no servers and does not send your data anywhere.\n\nThe app does not show ads, does not collect analytics and does not use advertising identifiers.\n\nPermissions: notifications are used for payment-date reminders. Contacts are read only for the one contact you pick.\n\nIf backup is turned on in your phone settings, Android may save the app data to your own Google account. You can also save a backup file yourself in Settings → Data.\n\nMessages to customers are sent through WhatsApp or SMS apps that you choose; Depter only prepares the text.\n\nQuestions: WhatsApp +996 709 992 092.</string>
